<title>USA: Cybernetic names Maynard chief executive.</title>
<headline>Cybernetic names Maynard chief executive.</headline>
<dateline>CHATSWORTH, Calif 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cybernetic Services Inc on Thursday said it named Charles Maynard as chief executive officer, replacing Neil Kohrn, who resigned.</p>
<p>Maynard was most recently chief executive officer of Progressive World Messaging (PWM), an international personal communications company.</p>
